{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","盖亚能量炮"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","ガイアフォース"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","首次释放终极技能时，亚古兽进化为战斗暴龙兽；后续释放终极技能时，战斗暴龙兽发射“盖亚能量炮”对大范围的敌人造成高额伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","初めて必殺技を発動する時、ウォーグレイモンに進化。その後、必殺技を発動する時、「ガイアフォース」で広範囲の敵に大ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在战斗中，亚古兽使用“小型火焰”作为普通攻击，对敌人造成150% ATK伤害。首次释放终极技能，亚古兽会进化为战斗暴龙兽，永久提升100%的生命值和50%的攻击力，并解锁其他技能。战斗暴龙兽释放终极技能时，向当前目标发射凝聚了大量能量的“盖亚能量炮”，对目标区域3格范围的敌人造成7段160% + 20% ATK攻击力的伤害，对处于范围中心的敌人造成的伤害提升至220% + 30% ATK，释放期间自身处于霸体状态。被动地，太一始终在场外处于无敌状态，并与自己的搭档并肩作战。每隔3秒，太一会鼓舞搭档，使其回复150点能量。亚古兽尚未进化为战斗暴龙兽时，每次通过这种方式回复的能量额外提升250点。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、アグモンは「ベビーフレイム」で通常攻撃を行い、敵に150% ATKのダメージを与える。初めて必殺技を発動する時、アグモンはウォーグレイモンに進化し、永続的にHP+100%、攻撃力+50%、他のスキルを解放。ウォーグレイモンが必殺技を発動する時、大量のエネルギーを集中させ、現在の攻撃対象に「ガイアフォース」を放ち、半径3マス以内の敵に160% + 20% ATKのダメージを7回与え、中央にいる敵に与えるダメージは220% + 30% ATKにUP。必殺技発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる。パッシブ効果：太一はフィールド外で無敵状態を維持し、パートナーのデジモンと一緒に戦う。3秒ごとに1回、太一はパートナーを鼓舞し、パートナーのSPが150回復。アグモンが進化する前、この効果によるSP回復量+250"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":146,"end":152,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":185,"end":191,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":175,"end":181,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":215,"end":221,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":142,"end":156,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":181,"end":195,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":204,"end":206,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":222,"end":224,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":29,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":171,"end":185,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":211,"end":225,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":239,"end":247,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":270,"end":272,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“盖亚能量炮”每段造成的伤害提升至170% + 20% ATK，对处于范围中心的敌人的伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「ガイアフォース」でエリア範囲内の敵に与える1回分のダメージが170% + 20% ATKにUPし、エリア中央にいる敵に与えるダメージが240% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“盖亚能量炮”每段造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK，对处于范围中心的敌人的伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「ガイアフォース」でエリア範囲内の敵に与える1回分のダメージが180% + 20% ATKにUPし、エリア中央にいる敵に与えるダメージが260% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“盖亚能量炮”每段造成的伤害提升至190% + 20% ATK，对处于范围中心的敌人的伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「ガイアフォース」でエリア範囲内の敵に与える1回分のダメージが190% + 20% ATKにUPし、エリア中央にいる敵に与えるダメージが280% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“盖亚能量炮”每段造成的伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK，对处于范围中心的敌人的伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","「ガイアフォース」でエリア範囲内の敵に与える1回分のダメージが200% + 20% ATKにUPし、エリア中央にいる敵に与えるダメージが300% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","战斗龙卷风"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","ブレイブトルネード"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","贯穿所有敌人，对途径的每个敌人造成伤害并眩晕。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵全体を貫通し、経路上の敵にダメージを与え、スタンを付与"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","高速旋转，依次贯穿所有敌人后回到原地，对途经的每个敌人造成420% + 40% ATK的伤害，并使其眩晕2秒，技能释放期间战斗暴龙兽处于无敌状态。本技能造成的伤害附带额外60点防御穿透。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","高速回転しながら突撃し、敵全体を順番に貫通した後、元の位置に戻る。経路上の敵に420% + 40% ATKのダメージを与え、2秒間のスタンを付与。スキル発動中、ウォーグレイモンは無敵状態になる。このスキルでダメージを与える時の防御貫通+60"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":89,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对途经的每个敌人造成的伤害提升至440% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","経路上の敵に与えるダメージが440% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对途经的每个敌人造成的伤害提升至460% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","経路上の敵に与えるダメージが460% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对途经的每个敌人造成的伤害提升至480% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","経路上の敵に与えるダメージが480% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","勇气之护"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","リカバリーシールド"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","获得护盾，期间霸体，并在持续时间结束后基于护盾剩余值回复生命值。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","シールドを獲得し、シールドの存在期間中はスーパーアーマー状態になり、シールドの存在時間終了後、残りシールド値に応じてHPを回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使自身获得700% + 100% ATK的护盾，持续10秒。护盾持续期间，战斗暴龙兽处于霸体状态。护盾持续时间结束后，战斗暴龙兽回复等同于该护盾剩余值150% + 10%的生命值。当亚古兽进化为战斗暴龙兽时，会立即获得1次勇气护盾。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","700% + 100% ATK分のシールドを10秒間獲得。シールドの存在期間中、ウォーグレイモンはスーパーアーマー状態になる。シールドの存在時間終了後、ウォーグレイモンは残りシールド値×150% + 10%分のHPを回復。アグモンがウォーグレイモンに進化した時点で、リカバリーシールドを1回獲得"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":79,"end":85,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":4,"end":11,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":97,"end":103,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/de